  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water as Leverage Academy Bangkok:</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Landprocess will play a pivotal role in the Canals as Leverage trajectory under the Water as Leverage (WaL) Academy Bangkok by contributing to the transformation of Bangkok&#x2019;s canal network into multifunctional assets that support ecological, social, and climate resilience. Landprocess willpartner with Defacto and a set of subcontractors to help deepen the co-creation approach in the WaL Academy. Together, they will catalyse transformative, design-led water solutions that reconnect water management to cultural heritage and urban liveability. Through active collaboration,Landprocess will bring its expertise in spatial planning and sustainable design to envision inclusive, nature-based  solutions (NbS) and green/grey infrastructure combinations, adapted to the diverse canal typologies in Bangkok. By fostering cross-sectoral partnerships and facilitating participatory processes, Landprocess will help translate innovative ideas into tangible, scalable actions, ensuringlong-term impact for Bangkok&#x2019;s future urban water resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
